    // An earlier version interpolated the caller's `brand` into the SVG's
    // aria-label — the paths were always safe (a keyed lookup), but the
    // label was a hole straight into markup this function assembles by
    // hand. Nothing a caller passes reaches the string now: the name comes
    // from our own table, and the accessible name is set through
    // setAttribute, which the DOM escapes.
